WEBVTT

00:13:28.975 --> 00:13:30.913
"Jeg er blevet scooped igen"

00:13:30.913 --> 00:13:32.248
"Scoop scoop"

00:13:32.248 --> 00:13:34.614
"Jeg er blevet scooped igen"

00:13:34.614 --> 00:13:35.989
"Scoop scoop"

00:13:35.989 --> 00:13:37.715
"Jeg er blevet scooped igen"

00:13:37.715 --> 00:13:38.948
"Scoop scoop"

00:13:38.948 --> 00:13:41.467
"Jeg er blevet scooped igen"

00:13:41.467 --> 00:13:42.645
"Scoop scoop"

00:13:42.645 --> 00:13:45.637
"Oh mama, føler du ikke min smerte"

00:13:45.637 --> 00:13:51.452
"Gud hjælpe mig, jeg er blevet scooped igen"

00:13:51.452 --> 00:13:57.938
(Applaus)

00:13:57.938 --> 00:13:58.916
Tak...

00:13:58.916 --> 00:14:00.395
Tak for jeres backingsang.